--- runtime tracing ---
strace: not installed
Install it with: apk add strace

Interpretation:
  no exact package / no armv7 candidate -> repository or architecture problem
  relocation / interpreter failure       -> userspace ABI problem
  ENOSYS                                  -> missing syscall; fallback or newer kernel
  EPERM/EOPNOTSUPP + namespace/cgroup     -> missing/restricted kernel feature
